  era: "Section 6 \xB7 Persian and Greek Invasions \xB7 c. 520 \u2013 300 BCE"
  title: Effects of Greek contact
  text: Alexander's campaign was brief, but it opened routes between India and the Greek world. Greek writers described India, Greek settlements remained in the north-west, and Greek influence later shaped Gandhara art and Indian coinage.
